{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "069826665f145acd6f1cf0e63749c343ad3a0dd844fee34612b24f4a27363332", "ja": "魅裏怨 -がっしょう-", "zh": "魅里怨──合唱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "030295d8d18d87de6a753c4e591f49613732b47122e97676a6f5a1b530afa9b7", "ja": "可奈は夢での会話を思い出し、ぷっぷかさん\nの未練はみんなと一緒に頑張りたかった事だ\nと思い付く。やがて全員の歌声が重なる時、\n気は浄化され……ぷっぷかさんは、昏睡状態\nの北上麗花の生霊だと判明するのだった。", "zh": "可奈想起和噗、噗卡小姐在梦中的对话，\n认为她的遗憾应该是想要与大家一起努力。\n当所有人的歌声交叠时，她的气息受到净化……\n噗、噗卡小姐的真实身分水落石出，\n原来她是从陷入昏迷的北上丽花出窍的生灵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "142f64d11ccfe94c672e60418267108c903dadfd480a2bf6f247cd51f3e89ce8", "ja": "……はれっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "17b9e804b70152feadf42b534860dc9378922f1efb7eea0b33f1a6cc2f5cc243", "ja": "今って、吹奏楽部の練習中だっけ？　そうだ。全国\n大会に向けて、みんなで曲を詰めてるところで……。", "zh": "刚刚那是管乐社正在练习吗？\n对了，为了迎接全国大赛，大家正在一起练习曲子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "c2145828c1b39fef1c6da45ac3ac0a28ec3e81d1dd1e49d9155e70b45e41826e", "ja": "可奈ちゃん。", "zh": "小可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "4f84dbedc2d31a6e2b14930197810c00e3831abdbf9fb4475526d5e554ce356a", "ja": "はいっ！\nすみません、ぼんやりしてて……。", "zh": "是！\n不好意思，我恍神了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "a10ffafb7b7c42a3ed070e9b9f3de05a3dfb5b9a00e034025f509324fd69b0a0", "ja": "ふふっ。可奈ちゃんは面白いなー。", "zh": "呵呵，小可奈还真是有趣呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "604f5b6cfa59d3f7e507d77f5a30b2bbb742020895c7beee028bbc3b5faf20ac", "ja": "みんなで演奏するの、とっても楽しいね。\nこの調子で、全国大会まで……。", "zh": "大家一起演奏很开心对吧。\n就照这个步调，在全国大赛前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "3d7b93a71e2d21bf4a80287c24222057108b4a381872d2a803d55575a40cd9f0", "ja": "一緒に頑張ろうね。", "zh": "一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "0971a7d5525d5bd0f819090dc4d979d26be2f33e469b1acb599b74769f3e1432", "ja": "あっ！！　私……私、わかりましたっ！　ここは\n旧校舎の、ぷっぷかさんが練習していた音楽室です！", "zh": "啊！！我……我知道了！这间旧校舍的教室，\n是噗、噗卡小姐之前用来练习的音乐教室！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "baaaadd12aa9dcf221a1b57adcb546c49ca598dc39de3dcfa17ea06511ddde2f", "ja": "ぷっぷかさんは吹奏楽部で、全国大会目指して頑張って\nたんです。だからきっと、未練っていうのは……。", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐之前是管乐社的社员，\n而且一直为了全国大赛在努力，所以她的遗憾肯定是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "1fc3a6a9943304f106a9b13ddaa2d2c1190f0508503eb859d6b2b5520616ba20", "ja": "きっと、みんなと一緒に頑張りたかったんです。\nみんなと一緒に、合奏したかったんだと思います！", "zh": "我认为她肯定是想要跟大家一起努力，\n想要跟大家一起合奏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "1831048758190b3ca2b5690cde2c97ba8721e93c8abe987993cb4c703e0284b8", "ja": "合奏、ですか……。しかし、今のこの状況を\n切り抜けられないことには……。", "zh": "合奏吗……\n但是必须先想办法突破这个窘境才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "a5a5d6db2a874ced31fe5ccd6d7d3aaa8a5d7c36a327b2b7257641a61a61871c", "ja": "私がぷっぷかさんと合奏します！", "zh": "就由我来跟噗、噗卡小姐合奏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "fe86a0e0a99c9c0b98ac9c2ad937cda2f0f06fc647b02247c9812be7bf24c8aa", "ja": "だって、私も吹奏楽部だもん！\n私がぷっぷかさんの願いを叶えてあげますっ！", "zh": "因为我也是管乐社的社员呀！\n所以就由我来实现噗、噗卡小姐的愿望！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "50c61bc3205a7fcfe64512cc67b047a7071799ed455d94698505712d3909363f", "ja": "矢吹さん！", "zh": "矢吹同学！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "e1b41665866b292f54cdba60f102c5eeac8c01a089505ca2588eaa09d8200d61", "ja": "可奈ちゃん！", "zh": "可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "ff4208e33e0888a080dba657c0038c41363f3237c60e1db305162cc40792982b", "ja": "クラリネットはないけれど……私には、歌があります！\nぷっぷかさん、私と歌で合奏しましょう！", "zh": "虽然这里没有竖笛……但是我可以唱歌！\n噗、噗卡小姐，跟我用歌声来合奏吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "4bcb1e1b32b21ae960372d589a276a236d9613704a7cc07b8ea0ce554f746650", "ja": "すぅ……。\n猪突も～しん♪　も～も～しん♪", "zh": "呼……\n向前～冲♪冲～冲～冲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "7e6af49f82778e2f42f9d38482d46159f4696dd0f30de7a0dc62033b9f892dd8", "ja": "ポルターガイストが……止んだ？", "zh": "骚灵现象……停止了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "437ba2628400b6df8b896e2fc05696362396bc0720b5fa86489751d03fbad549", "ja": "すごい……。矢吹さんの歌には、不思議な力が\nあるようです。……いろいろな意味で。", "zh": "好厉害……矢吹同学的歌似乎拥有不可思议的力量……\n从各种方面来说都是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
