{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "c1d51454e54140e5194ec5fa5e3042c010f73e8d4721cdb89df25d3887f4d53c", "ja": "すごい……。ぷっぷかさんの気が浄化されていきます。\nひ、光に……なって……。", "zh": "真是惊人……噗、噗卡小姐的气息逐渐被净化。\n化、化成了……光芒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "cace04778223f3787cd5259c572c213ecb88210cef583098e59feedf9c6f0bfa", "ja": "ぷっぷかさん。迷わず成仏して\nください。……なーむー。", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐，\n请不要迷惘，安心成佛吧……南──无──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "5aeab09c0e860ee3736db1bb5f161727b03a0977603e640b8ef02228ddc8ebc2", "ja": "あ、あの、ちょっと……ま、待ってください。", "zh": "那、那个，等等……稍、稍等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "1ab3c2c469855edd49a22a419719baa233b40d9dd3dde2ecbcb030ac0ac610fd", "ja": "どうかしましたか。ぷっぷかさんは安らかに\n成仏しました。……これぞ大団円。", "zh": "怎么了吗？噗、噗卡小姐已经安心成佛了。\n……这下就圆满收场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "c4b04930829874800144157e86f98051fb98f347cd091c5dd67683f772c6ceaa", "ja": "実は、そのう……", "zh": "其实，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "a097a4ca7f71ea7aec73fc3259afe5068f26d8b8c2cbb018cb6abcef782ac98a", "ja": "すぅ……すぅ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "e01cacb9839c325f29667b3283dfed464295aacaf6d50f52ede551e8d9afa3b0", "ja": "生きてる。", "zh": "她还活着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "ac5157477d7dcaa068519fc518b518f4cf3349e1236f92b637e33502526760d4", "ja": "寝てる……。", "zh": "正在睡觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "fda817542423996bf9aa8d187e7b880da1e5cf2c255983cd35d669f490d310bd", "ja": "血色がいいです。", "zh": "气色很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "6b0a169b3b01bef31453562db9997cd15195552e38f40f9f4f2bea8e9c2cadb1", "ja": "は、はい……。皆さんのおかげで、すっかり……。", "zh": "是、是的……多亏了大家，她完全恢复了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "0df83f76d2f2da6e859a12aeb12becc3de921ecaf91740cf52fff16016b6ecbd", "ja": "ぷっぷかさんは幽霊ではなかったのですね。昏睡状態の\n北上麗花さんから、魂だけが抜け出たもの。……生霊。", "zh": "原来噗、噗卡小姐并不是幽灵呢，而是从陷入昏迷的\n北上丽花小姐出窍的灵魂……也就是生灵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1043_045kar", "source_sha256": "bec20447d720d6abaa80bffc74409e5c6d29d8634d85c52bd4d553fc9cea7353", "ja": "は、はい。麗花さんのご家族の方が……\n日本支部を通じて……わ、私に、依頼を……。", "zh": "是、是的，丽花小姐的家人……透过了日本分部……\n向、向我提出了委托……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1044_019min", "source_sha256": "ab147299f87a857e0c850dd49a3f4c4dc8e36b8ab2969e953d3daa123500da66", "ja": "あの、ぷっぷかさん……じゃなくて麗花さんは、\nまだ目を覚まさないんですか？", "zh": "那个，噗、噗卡小姐她……\n不对，丽花小姐她还不会醒来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1045_045kar", "source_sha256": "07598ec2f1fce4c4fb046a5d9041b49029c6c865ad051bd1a60d459b3677410c", "ja": "も、もう、まもなく……だと、思います……。\n抜けていた魂が、戻って来ましたから……。", "zh": "我、我想应该……马上就会醒来了……\n因为脱离的灵魂已经回来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1046_019min", "source_sha256": "8abe4eb0af6b4d7ffe501883f3f60a56857e90d05364a7b10b4b1b01267fa070", "ja": "そっかぁ。早く覚めるといいな……。\n私、麗花さんとは友達になれると思うんだ。", "zh": "这样啊，希望丽花小姐能赶快醒来……\n我觉得自己应该能跟她成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "eb79765f8b7b87c19fad6302a7a77413ea26a2acb1a93ecc34f1aaa2fc141342", "ja": "麗花さんが乗り移ってた時、なんとなくだけど。優しい\n気持ち、楽しい気持ちが、いっぱい伝わって来たから。", "zh": "丽花小姐附身在我身上时，虽然只是隐隐约约，\n但我能感受到有许多温柔、快乐的心情传递过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1048_036kan", "source_sha256": "464c2ab1ba01aea25e48c382904402e1c8341646e95eaa54df3f35ffa4e52b82", "ja": "私も！　麗花さんと声を合わせて、わさんぼ～んって\n歌った時は、とっても気持ちよかったな～♪", "zh": "我也是！在跟丽花小姐一起唱着「和三盆～」的时候，\n感觉非常舒畅呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1049_044miz", "source_sha256": "ee2bad253df31795e2e7e7f2fe7e419bcfe9ec6c4d7de788c60570f64ec55462", "ja": "生きたまま学校の怪談になった人。オカルト部として\n興味があります。……お友達になりたい。", "zh": "身为超自然研究社成员，我对还活着就成为\n学校鬼故事的人非常感兴趣……想跟她成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1050_045kar", "source_sha256": "d4a739cf472adaa237f5904d14199510494c057769099dd083c43ba0b9969a1e", "ja": "はい……。きっと、なれると思います……。", "zh": "嗯……我想你们一定能成为朋友的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1051_036kan", "source_sha256": "b7d44af0cb2d1360a1cf774cee9e826a099583feaed8e88b381c57dfd20c074c", "ja": "猪突も～しん……♪ も～も～しん……♪　\nさんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪", "zh": "向前～冲……♪冲～冲～冲……♪\n一盆、两盆、和三盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1052_048rei", "source_sha256": "e0f5f2dca77e96c5b1746f17eb42abc1eefafdad660b9cf6583b9cc4eaf6c67c", "ja": "わ……さん、ぼん～……♪", "zh": "和……三、盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1053_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ebf25c1dc4fea3b464d7b129d2970aebd52779be7bd973d533ea8e3ff27d499", "ja": "麗花さん！？", "zh": "丽花小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1054_048rei", "source_sha256": "49bba5dad82dd14ef4a1a4421f03fa67259453552a93d1c2952d69bdde69b58d", "ja": "んっ……。\nん～……っ！", "zh": "嗯……\n嗯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_06_1055_048rei", "source_sha256": "174e171b49ee082340e0e0d295999f4c64fb39543c9d3cc8a22b1a2f25fb38b6", "ja": "あ……可奈ちゃん、みんな、おっはよう……。\n今日も……一緒に頑張ろうね♪", "zh": "啊……小可奈，还有大家，早安呀……\n今天也……一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
